## 3. Artifact và dependency contract

| ID | Artifact | Tạo bởi | Được dùng bởi |
|---|---|---|---|
| A0 | User Financial Input Packet | Người dùng / P0 | P1–P4 |
| A1 | Financial Situation Summary | P1 | P2, P6, P7 |
| A2 | Financial State Map | P2 | P3, P4, P6, P7 |
| A3 | Risk Profile / Risk Considerations | P3 | P4, P5, P6, P7 |
| A4 | Investment Analysis Pack | P4 | P5, P6, P7 |
| A5 | Comparison Matrix | P5 | P6, P7 |
| A6 | Draft Decision Support Brief | P6 | P7 |
| A7 | Validation Report | P7 | Release gate |
| A8 | Final Decision Support Brief | P7 sau PASS | Người dùng |

Mỗi artifact phải có:

```yaml
artifact_id: A1-A8
version: 1.0
created_at: YYYY-MM-DD
source_artifacts: []
status: PASS | PASS_WITH_CAVEATS | NEEDS_INPUT | REVISE | BLOCK | NOT_APPLICABLE
facts: []
derived_values: []
assumptions: []
missing_data: []
caveats: []
confidence: HIGH | MEDIUM | LOW
```

